Port KiCad's IPC listener to NNG 2 without the NNG1_TRANSITION aliases.
The library reference is scoped to the listener, received messages are freed,
and shutdown wakes a listener waiting for a reply.
API references:
https://github.com/nanomsg/nng/blob/v2.1.0/docs/ref/migrate/nng1.md
https://github.com/nanomsg/nng/blob/v2.1.0/src/core/init.c

